  "title": "神秘复兴 Thaumic Renaissance",
  "description": "A thaumcraft 6 modpack with almost all the TC6 addons.",
  "body": "A thaumcraft modpack with almost all the thaumcraft addons and botania mod.\n\n0 tech mod, 0 TC6-unrelated magic mod, 0 cheaty mod !\n\nThis pack ONLY have thaumcraft and it's addons, if you need more, please download them youself.\n\nUse Thaumic Merger merged lots of addon's research to vanilla TC Page, say bye-bye to empty TC6-Research Page.\n\nReturned Thaumic Tinkerer Kami-series, Forbidden Magic and Curtive Vat in Thaumic Horizons.\n\nFixed Planar Artifice, Crimson Revelations and Thaumic Bases Unofficial.\n\nImpetus now can active a multiblock-smelter with 0 flux pollution.\n\nCustom Item tooltip borders for each addons inspired by RL-tooltip borders.\n\nA mysterious trinket called T12 let you ignore TC6's annoying research system.\n\nQuests already available on English. (Thanks DJdemon3056)\n\n\nUse Bauble mod from: [https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/baubles](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/baubles)\n\nUse thaumcraft 6 mod from: [https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thaumcraft](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thaumcraft)\n\nUse bibliocraft mod from: [https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bibliocraft](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bibliocraft)\n\nUse Gravestone mod from: [https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gravestone-mod](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gravestone-mod)\n\n\nAlso use Sonomagy as a nice soundpack: [https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sonomagy](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sonomagy)",
